      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: ₹0.43 loss per share (vs ₹0.30 loss in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: ₹0.43 loss per share (further deteriorated from ₹0.30 loss in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹4.71b (up 24% from 3Q 2025). Net loss: ₹30.8m (loss widened 41% from 3Q 2025). Revenue is forecast to grow 17% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, while revenues in the Basic Materials industry in India are expected to remain flat. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 37% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 15% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
